[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10921.19, "timestamp": "03:02:01", "text": "他们自己完成了装饰。我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10925.75, "timestamp": "03:02:05", "text": "直接在23号或24号直播就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10928.95, "timestamp": "03:02:08", "text": "是的，这样好多了。在卡瓦伊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10931.99, "timestamp": "03:02:11", "text": "不过，这又是一个想法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10933.83, "timestamp": "03:02:13", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10937.11, "timestamp": "03:02:17", "text": "是的，呃，既然已经过了5个小时了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10939.349, "timestamp": "03:02:19", "text": "35分钟后，我们就结束今天的节目了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10951.11, "timestamp": "03:02:31", "text": "呃，我们就到此为止吧。所有的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10953.83, "timestamp": "03:02:33", "text": "今天来过的人。啊，还有第一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10955.91, "timestamp": "03:02:35", "text": "人们，我们第一个来的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10959.269, "timestamp": "03:02:39", "text": "今天是Nanx日。谢谢你，Nanx。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10960.87, "timestamp": "03:02:40", "text": "感谢你今天光临。我真的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10962.79, "timestamp": "03:02:42", "text": "意义重大。希望你喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10965.269, "timestamp": "03:02:45", "text": "太感谢了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10967.75, "timestamp": "03:02:47", "text": "谢谢。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10970.87, "timestamp": "03:02:50", "text": "呃，第一个参与的人是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10973.91, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "text": "Twitch 上的第一个人是 NX。 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10975.429, "timestamp": "03:02:55", "text": "是克洛诺斯。谢谢你，克洛诺斯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10977.83, "timestamp": "03:02:57", "text": "路过。睡得好。谢谢你，忍者"}]